**`TypeUtils.java`**
- `LinkedList` → `ArrayList` for all four local lists (all used for `add`/`addAll` then streamed or passed to `unmodifiableList`) — removed the unused `LinkedList` import

**`AbstractInterfaceConfig.java`**
- Three `x != null && x.size() > 0` guards → `CollectionUtils.isNotEmpty(x)` — consistent with the import already present

**`AbstractConfigManager.java`**
- `configsMap.size() > 0` → `!configsMap.isEmpty()`

